    "history_harmed": "Among accepted batches: birth_damage.history>0 or half_fade_damage.history>0 against its immediate baseline, after an accepted birth for fade. Batch count, not damaged pair count.",
    "gradient_ratio": "Median of cross_boundary_gradient_l2/local_gradient_l2 across all1024 completed updates, including update1; undefined updates disclosed, never silently dropped.",
    "gradient_scope": "Live-loss components before auxiliary combination, clipping or Adam. Cross-boundary includes all pre-block history; it is not lag>128 or retention.",
    "fade_zero_threshold": "At executed fade: abs(fade_old_weight)<=fade_lr. Counts are selected candidate occurrences/batches; pending proposals excluded. Accepted half fade requires nonzero final_weight==0.5*old_weight.",
    "proposal_pool": "At generated_update, eligibility mask_at_proposal intersect abs(weight_at_proposal)<=proposal_lr; repeated pair/window appearances count separately. Selected weak is intersection with proposal fade_indices."
  },
